	(text "There's 2 connectors because UART1 is\na pin header but JST_UART1 is a JST_ZH\nconnector intended to be used with an\nLD2450 or other device that takes UART\nover JST_ZH"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 275.844 120.904 0)
